omt modifications
-----------------

This copy is a modified fork, not a verbatim vendored upstream release. Files
under src/ and tests/ have been edited for omt; the changes are covered by the
same MIT terms as the rest of omt. The crate is built as a workspace member
(name/version/edition/license inherited from the workspace Cargo.toml, license
= "MIT"), and it depends only on workspace dependencies plus reqwest.

Surface that differs from or extends the upstream TypeScript/Primer Agent loop,
as present in this tree:

  * src/proxy.rs - streams completions through a proxy server
    (POST {proxyUrl}/api/stream) instead of calling providers directly; the
    server strips the `partial` field and the partial assistant message is
    reconstructed client-side from SSE `data:` lines.
  * Compaction epoch - `AgentLoopConfig::compaction_epoch` (src/agent_loop/mod.rs)
    and `Agent::compaction_epoch` / `set_compaction_epoch` (src/agent.rs) record
    the epoch on assistant `contextSnapshot`s.
  * System prompt hook - `AgentLoopConfig::get_system_prompt`, resolved per model
    call in src/agent_loop/response.rs, overriding the context system prompt.
  * Per-run routing fields - `service_tier` and `credential_id` on the loop
    config, carried into stream requests and stamped onto assistant messages.
  * src/scripted.rs and tests/agent_loop_scripted.rs, tests/listener_reentry.rs -
    scripted provider/dispatcher doubles used by omt's test suite.
  * `prepare_dispatch` (src/agent_loop/response.rs) freezes the context message
    list before running `beforeToolCall` hooks so hooks and tool executions
    snapshot one version of the history.

Upstream revision history is not vendored here, so this list is a description of
the current tree, not an authoritative diff against a pinned upstream commit.

